    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>制作 | 汤包包</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持 | 汤包包、王贪贪</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾 | 麻小（新晋人夫）</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是《城市药丸》的第一期节目，我们选择了 广告文案 作为话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>吐槽部分你会听到</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=04:40"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a></span></span><span> 广告文案到底要负责写多少文案？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=12:30"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a></span></span><span> 小游戏：一起来猜猜这些文案都用了什么可怕的谐音梗？</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=25:20"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a></span></span><span> 支付宝的某个开屏广告是如何惹怒汤包包的？（与LGBT群体相关）</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=34:50"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2090">34:50</a></span></span><span> 一看再看，二次伤害，B站《后浪》如何造成文案工作者“工伤”。</span></p><span></span><p><span href="#t=55:20"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3320">55:20</a></span></span><span> 推荐我们喜欢的文案</span></p><span></span><p><span>麻小：路边彩票投注站令人心动的文案《只不过，你忘了取款密码》</span></p><span></span><p><span>汤包包：树木希林2017年某百货TVC</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Mx411y7rk?from=search&amp;seid=13418284731228457888" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Mx411y7rk?from=search&amp;seid=13418284731228457888"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>王贪贪：1998台北诚品商城春季特卖文案</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩内容，欢迎各位关注微信公众号“城市药丸”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这第一粒“药丸”祝大家服用愉快</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你有任何问题或者建议，可以先写邮件给我们citypills@hotmaill.com</span></p>]]></description>
